.com/2022/11/09/berchtesgaden-bavaria-maria-gern-hintersee-and-ramsau/","https://topologica.co/place/hintersee-lake/","https://www.theurbankids.com/en/hiking-in-berchtesgaden-with-kids/"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Jenner cable car to the ridge above the lake","type":"activity","detail":"A gondola from the lakeside lifts you to a viewing deck looking down the whole length of the water and across to the big east face.","season":[5,6,7,8,9,10],"link":"https://www.berchtesgaden.de/en/cable-cars/jennerbahn","evidence":{"n_sources":3,"of":20,"urls":["https://www.berchtesgaden.de/en/cable-cars/jennerbahn","https://tourismattractions.net/germany/berchtesgaden-attractions-opening-hours","https://alpsbydesign.com/articles/berchtesgaden-and-the-konigssee-guide"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Advent market and the masked winter runs","type":"festival","detail":"The town keeps a rough old Advent, with market stalls followed in December by straw clad figures and shooting troops in the streets.","season":[11,12],"evidence":{"n_sources":3,"of":20,"urls":["https://www.berchtesgaden.de/en/top-experiences/berchtesgaden-christmas-market","https://www.edelweiss-berchtesgaden.com/en/nature-culture/event-calendar/","https://tourismattractions.net/germany/best-time-visit-berchtesgaden"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Salzbergwerk Berchtesgaden","type":"activity","detail":"Salzbergwerk","sources":["heritage","osm","wikidata","wikipedia"],"evidence":{"method":"open","n_sources":4,"sources":["heritage","osm","wikidata","wikipedia"]}},{"name":"Kehlstein","type":"activity","detail":"Berg in den Berchtesgadener Alpen","sources":["osm","wikidata","wikipedia"],"evidence":{"method":"open","n_sources":3,"sources":["osm","wikidata","wikipedia"]}}],"nearby":{"trails":[{"layer":"trails","cc":"AT","id":"12348","name":"Via Alpina Purple A44","km":18.0,"bearing":"W","lat":47.6325,"lon":12.76345,"tier":2,"thumb":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/th